n- **Rollback:** The first `rollback` to v2.3.0 halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed. I verified the state, retried, and the second attempt rolled out to all three regions successfully.\n- **Verification:** All regions now on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and follow-ups. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it had been created, so I did not retry and avoided a duplicate page.\n\n**Follow-ups for the team:** investigate the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying, and look into the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}